From 8e862f5e636c0e081d577b73e9e2e8decd5d828b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:44:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs: drop FreeBSD support (release.yml, docs)

Remove the freebsd job from release.yml, its publish inputs and the
freebsd-backfill.yml workflow. Remove FreeBSD from the README, the site
and the scripts README. CHANGELOG.md history is unchanged.

Fixes #2570

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
