 .github/workflows/freebsd-backfill.yml        | 140 ------------------
 .github/workflows/release.yml                 |  46 +-----
 README.md                                     |  16 +-
 scripts/README.md                             |   4 +-
 site/content/_index.md                        |   4 +-
 site/content/developers/crates.md             |   2 +-
 site/content/guide/getting-started/install.md |   6 +-
 8 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 208 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 .github/workflows/freebsd-backfill.yml

